+# Phase B import Worker design adoption
+
+2026-10-23. Adopt original Task5 accepted requirements plus additive R1 under artifacts/phase-b/b-remaining/controller-import-worker-design/. Original/review/R1/closure/additive diff/independent R1 review remain exact with manifest. R1 SHA2567abe66e4fb2ae304df29ad62d374455c86a928d41fa4ba03f2d78fd268a284f4; independent reviewdfa0e697b58bf367141ad58a3295e578480b29ceaad49e035e0c9434f22f2d14. T5DR-01/02 ADDRESSED, SPEC/design PASS at design level only. No implementation, test, source-stream, Worker installation, phase or company qualification follows.
+
+New production import completion is queue-confined. Queue retains actual DomainScope in ValidatedLease, authenticates the unfinished attempt after all task locks, privately creates AfterTask and invokes the constructor-bound registered policy. An inert private carrier.get always rejects; same-call private invocation writes and validates actual RAW output under queue-owned one-use phases, exact queue/policy/issuer/DataSource/active holder/full spec/task/attempt/prelocked graph/plan identities. Public data-only lifecycle envelope preserves the carrier and deny-only callback admission without granting authority. No public mint/setter, ThreadLocal/global plan cache, alternate issuer, late existing root acquisition or recursive source/lease read. Existing unrelated Supplier/Runnable semantics remain.
